["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ロープ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绳；绳子；缆绳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222993\">このロープは<ruby>強<rp>(</rp><rt>つよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这条绳子很强大。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">和</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">和；总和；和谐；和平；日本；日式；和式</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214351\">スポーツではチームの<ruby>和<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>成功<rp>(</rp><rt>せいこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>欠<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かせません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在体育运动中,球队和队伍的成功是不缺少的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">枠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">框架；框架结构；边框；方框；框；限制；限额；配额；类别；范围；等级；时段；播出时段；直播；网络直播；线轴；卷轴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201889\">ドアが<ruby>枠<rp>(</rp><rt>わく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わなければ<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うまでドアにかんなをかけなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果门不符合框架,就必须在门上打开,直到它相匹配。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=