<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">足够不必来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:煩わしい\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">煩わしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わずらわしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">麻烦的；繁琐的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>手続<rp>(</rp><rt>てつづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きが<ruby>煩<rp>(</rp><rt>わずら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わしくて、<ruby>途中<rp>(</rp><rt>とちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でやめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">手续太繁琐，中途放弃了。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渡り鳥</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わたりどり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">候鸟；过境鸟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ワット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瓦特</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">詫び</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">わび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道歉；认错；谢罪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeb